---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="页面未找到">
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap contact-block" style="min-height: 60vh; display: grid; align-content: center;">
      <div class="contact-card" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="eyebrow">404 / Signal Lost</p>
        <h2>这条路径还没有记录。</h2>
        <p>可能是链接发生了变化，也可能这篇内容仍在整理中。回到首页继续浏览吧。</p>
        <div class="contact-actions">
          <a class="contact-btn primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
          <a class="contact-btn" href="/#projects">浏览项目</a>
          <a class="contact-btn" href="/#blog">阅读文章</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
